xion and strong alignment with the required hip-extension moment.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 143.08, "fcsa_contribution_cm2": 103.55}, {"E_LT": 0.8800, "E_MA": 0.8800, "E_ND": 0.8400, "E_LoA": 0.9300, "E_mech": 0.6050, "muscle": "vastus_medialis", "rationale": "Directly produces knee-extension torque with favorable patellar leverage while sharing the total knee demand with the other vasti.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 117.38, "fcsa_contribution_cm2": 71.01}, {"E_LT": 0.9400, "E_MA": 0.8800, "E_ND": 0.9000, "E_LoA": 0.8200, "E_mech": 0.6105, "muscle": "adductor_magnus", "rationale": "Its posterior fibers provide substantial hip-extension torque from deep hip flexion, while nonextensor fibers reduce whole-muscle task alignment.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 105.22, "fcsa_contribution_cm2": 64.24}, {"E_LT": 0.8200, "E_MA": 0.7200, "E_ND": 0.6000, "E_LoA": 0.7000, "E_mech": 0.2480, "muscle": "soleus", "rationale": "Produces plantar-flexion torque to resist the footplate-induced dorsiflexion moment while the heel remains planted.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 217.92, "fcsa_contribution_cm2": 54.04}, {"E_LT": 0.9000, "E_MA": 0.8700, "E_ND": 0.8600, "E_LoA": 0.9400, "E_mech": 0.6330, "muscle": "vastus_intermedius", "rationale": "Monoarticular knee extensor with strong task alignment and favorable deep-flexion force availability.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 70.35, "fcsa_contribution_cm2": 44.53}, {"E_LT": 0.8500, "E_MA": 0.8200, "E_ND": 0.6200, "E_LoA": 0.5800, "E_mech": 0.2506, "muscle": "rectus_femoris", "rationale": "Contributes knee-extension torque, but its simultaneous hip-flexion action opposes the required hip-extension moment and reduces net alignment.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 91.44, "fcsa_contribution_cm2": 22.91}, {"E_LT": 0.8000, "E_MA": 0.7500, "E_ND": 0.5000, "E_LoA": 0.5000, "E_mech": 0.1500, "muscle": "semimembranosus", "rationale": "Provides some hip-extension torque, but its knee-flexion moment opposes the required knee-extension action and limits net task contribution.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 88.78, "fcsa_contribution_cm2": 13.32}, {"E_LT": 0.4500, "E_MA": 0.6500, "E_ND": 0.4500, "E_LoA": 0.4500, "E_mech": 0.0592, "muscle": "gastrocnemius", "rationale": "Assists plantar flexion, but deep knee flexion shortens it and its knee-flexion moment opposes the required knee-extension torque.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 183.54, "fcsa_contribution_cm2": 10.87}, {"E_LT": 0.8200, "E_MA": 0.7400, "E_ND": 0.5000, "E_LoA": 0.5500, "E_mech": 0.1669, "muscle": "biceps_femoris_long_head", "rationale": "Assists hip extension from the flexed position, but its concurrent knee-flexion action substantially reduces its net contribution.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 53.70, "fcsa_contribution_cm2": 8.96}, {"E_LT": 0.8800, "E_MA": 0.5500, "E_ND": 0.4500, "E_LoA": 0.4500, "E_mech": 0.0980, "muscle": "adductor_longus_brevis", "rationale": "Contributes a small hip-extension component at high hip flexion, but most of the combined muscle group is not strongly aligned with the sagittal-plane task.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 66.55, "fcsa_contribution_cm2": 6.52}, {"E_LT": 0.8000, "E_MA": 0.7200, "E_ND": 0.4800, "E_LoA": 0.5500, "E_mech": 0.1521, "muscle": "semitendinosus", "rationale": "Provides limited hip-extension assistance while its knee-flexion action counteracts part of the required knee-extension moment.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 25.59, "fcsa_contribution_cm2": 3.89}], "effective_resistance": {"assumptions": ["The nominal load is the combined plate mass and a representative 45 kg uncounterbalanced sled carriage is added.", "The rail is inclined at 45 degrees and bearing friction is treated as negligible.", "The athlete uses a shoulder-width stance, keeps the heels planted, and reaches a deep but controlled bottom position.", "Representative bilateral external moment arms are 0.164 m at the knee, 0.148 m at the hip, and 0.048 m at the ankle."], "loaded_joints": [{"joint": "knee_bilateral", "estimated_external_moment_nm": 278.70}, {"joint": "hip_bilateral", "estimated_external_moment_nm": 251.50}, {"join