ion and posterior tilt while maintaining thoracic contact. A small increment reflects continuous fixation accompanying the supplied dynamic contribution.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 36.03, "mechanical_roles": ["scapular_control", "propulsive", "load_transmission", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.1665, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 5.55, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric", "isometric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 6.00, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "trapezius_lower", "rationale": "Supports scapular upward rotation, posterior tilt, and elevation control. A modest increment reflects sustained scapular fixation throughout the raise.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 14.98, "mechanical_roles": ["scapular_control", "load_transmission", "eccentric_control", "isometric_fixation"], "tension_fraction": 0.3004, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 4.09, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric", "isometric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 4.50, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "deltoid_posterior", "rationale": "Assists abduction and transverse-plane humeral control, particularly when the arm remains close to the scapular plane. The supplied contribution is retained unchanged.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 24.65, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "joint_stabilization", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.1469, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 3.62, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric", "isometric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 3.62, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "obliques", "rationale": "Resists lateral trunk flexion and rotation caused by the unilateral cable load. A small increment reflects continuous anti-lean and anti-rotation bracing.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 81.71, "mechanical_roles": ["trunk_bracing", "antagonist_co_contraction", "isometric_fixation", "l