us bilateral bracing and controlled force regulation throughout the press-out and return.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 81.71, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "trunk_bracing", "isometric_fixation", "eccentric_control", "multi_joint_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.3427, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 26.96, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile", "dynamic_eccentric", "dynamic_concentric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 28.00, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_propulsive"}, {"muscle": "rectus_abdominis", "rationale": "Maintains ribcage-to-pelvis alignment and prevents lumbar extension while rotational cable force is transmitted through the trunk. A small increment reflects sustained anterior bracing.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 24.29, "mechanical_roles": ["trunk_bracing", "isometric_fixation", "load_transmission", "antagonist_co_contraction"], "tension_fraction": 0.3911, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 8.99, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 9.50, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "gluteus_medius", "rationale": "Stabilizes the pelvis in the frontal and transverse planes while the cable attempts to rotate the torso over the fixed stance. A small increment reflects continuous bilateral pelvic control.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 113.75, "mechanical_roles": ["joint_stabilization", "limb_position_maintenance", "isometric_fixation", "load_transmission"], "tension_fraction": 0.0633, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 6.83, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 7.20, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "erector_spinae", "rationale": "Maintains spinal extension and segmental stiffness while resisting cable-induced rotation and flexion. A modest increment reflects sustained posterior trunk co-contraction.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 106.48, "mechanical_roles": ["trunk_bracing", "isometric_fixation", "load_transmission", "antagonist_co_contraction"], "tension_fraction": 0.0657, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 6.39, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 7.00, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "deltoid_anterior", "rationale": "Assists the forward press-out and maintains the arms at approximately sternum or shoulder height against the cable. A small increment reflects continuous humeral-position stabilization.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 30.46, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "limb_position_maintenance", "joint_stabilization", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.1806, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 5.03, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric", "isometric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 5.50, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "rotator_cuffs", "rationale": "Centres the humeral heads while the extended arms amplify the cable's rotational and transverse loading. A modest increment reflects sustained glenohumeral stabilization.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 170.80, "mechanical_roles": ["joint_stabilization", "load_transmission", "isometric_fixation", "multi_joint_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.0293, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 4.27, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 5.00, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "serratus_anterior", "rationale": "Contributes to scapular protraction during the press-out while maintaining scapular contact with the thorax. A small increment reflects continuous scapular fixation.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 36.03, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "scapular_control", "load_transmission", "isometric_fixation"], "tension_fraction": 0.1110, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 3.60, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric", "isometric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 4.00, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "transverse_abdominis", "rationale": "Provides circumferential abdominal stiffness and transfers rotational force between the thorax and pelvis. A small increment reflects sustained deep bracing.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 21.97, "mechanical_roles": ["trunk_bracing", "isometric_fixation", "load_transmission"], "tension_fraction": 0.1639, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 3.30, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 3.60, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "gluteus_maximus", "rationale": "Maintains hip extension and transverse-plane pelvic stability against the cable's rotational moment. A small increment reflects continuous stance stabilization.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 143.08, "mechanical_roles": ["joint_stabilization", "limb_position_maintenance", "isometric_fixation", "trunk_bracing"], "tension_fraction": 0.0224, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 2.86, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 3.20, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "triceps_lateral_head", "rationale": "Extends the elbow during the press-out and controls elbow flexion during the return while helping maintain the fully extended-arm position. The supplied value is retained unchanged.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 36.10, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "eccentric_control", "limb_position_maintenance"], "tension_fraction": 0.0701, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 2.53, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric", "isometric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 2.53, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_propulsive"}, {"muscle": "wrist_flexors", "rationale": "Maintains the cable-handle grip and transmits the offset load through the hands while resisting unwanted wrist extension.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 54.40, "mechanical_roles": ["grip_maintenance", "isometric_fixation", "load_transmission"], "tension_fraction": 0.0460, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 0.00, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 2.50, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "gluteus_minimus", "rationale": "Assists femoral-head and pelvic stabilization while the stance resists transverse-plane cable force. A small increment reflects continuous hip stabilization.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 24.82, "mechanical_roles": ["joint_stabilization", "limb_position_maintenance", "isometric_fixation"], "tension_fraction": 0.0685, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 1.49, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 1.70, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "adductor_longus_brevis", "rationale": "Complements the gluteal stabilizers by maintaining femoral and pelvic alignment against rotational displacement.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 66.55, "mechanical_roles": ["joint_stabilization", "limb_position_maintenance", "antagonist_co_contraction", "isometric_fixation"], "tension_fraction": 0.0225, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 0.00, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 1.50, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "soleus", "rationale": "Provides ankle stiffness and postural control while the offset cable load attempts to shift the centre of pressure.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 217.92, "mechanical_roles": ["limb_position_maintenance", "isometric_fixation", "load_transmission"], "tension_fraction": 0.0069, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 0.00, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 1.50, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "triceps_