osition. The supplied value already represents its complete dynamic force state.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 43.85, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "eccentric_control", "load_transmission"], "tension_fraction": 0.7824, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 34.31, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 34.31, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_propulsive"}, {"muscle": "wrist_flexors", "rationale": "Maintains the pronated closed grip and transmits the full suspended body load through the fingers and hand. The supplied value already reflects the substantial grip demand and is retained unchanged.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 54.40, "mechanical_roles": ["grip_maintenance", "isometric_fixation", "load_transmission"], "tension_fraction": 0.5355, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 29.13, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 29.13, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "brachialis", "rationale": "Produces substantial elbow-flexion torque independently of forearm pronation and controls elbow extension during the descent. No separate stabilization component is added.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 44.05, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.6552, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 28.86, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 28.86, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_propulsive"}, {"muscle": "rhomboids", "rationale": "Contributes to scapular retraction and downward-rotation control while stabilizing the medial border against thoracic movement. A small increment accounts for continuous scapular fixation beyond the supplied movement-producing baseline.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 28.25, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "scapular_control", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.5841, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 15.36, "contraction_character": ["