ompanying the supplied dynamic contribution.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 36.03, "mechanical_roles": ["scapular_control", "load_transmission", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.2220, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 7.36, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric", "isometric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 8.00, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "deltoid_lateral", "rationale": "Assists humeral elevation and frontal-plane stabilization during the inclined press. The supplied value already captures its secondary dynamic and stabilizing force state.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 45.73, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "joint_stabilization", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.1286, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 5.88, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 5.88, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "wrist_flexors", "rationale": "Maintains the bar grip and transmits pressing force through the hands while resisting wrist extension.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 54.40, "mechanical_roles": ["grip_maintenance", "isometric_fixation", "load_transmission"], "tension_fraction": 0.0368, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 0.00, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 2.00, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "pectoralis_minor", "rationale": "Provides minor anterior scapular fixation and load transmission against the bench. A small increment reflects continuous stabilization without overstating its contribution.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 10.81, "mechanical_roles": ["scapular_control", "load_transmission", "isometric_fixation"], "tension_fraction": 0.1388, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 1.12, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 1.50, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "trapezius_lower", "rationale": "Regulates scapular elevation and posterior tilt while the serratus and upper pressing musculature transmit force through the shoulder girdle.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 14.98, "mechanical_roles": ["scapular_control", "load_transmission", "isometric_fixation"], "tension_fraction": 0.1001, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 0.00, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 1.50, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "wrist_extensors", "rationale": "Co-contracts with the wrist flexors to preserve neutral wrist alignment beneath the fixed bar.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 53.67, "mechanical_roles": ["grip_maintenance", "antagonist_co_contraction", "isometric_fixation"], "tension_fraction": 0.0279, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 0.00, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 1.50, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "obliques", "rationale": "Provides low-level anti-rotation and lateral trunk stability while the torso remains supported against the incline bench.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 81.71, "mechanical_roles": ["trunk_bracing", "antagonist_co_contraction", "isometric_fixation"], "tension_fraction": 0.0184, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 0.00, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 1.50, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "trapezius_middle", "rationale": "Maintains medial scapular stability and limits uncontrolled protraction while the shoulder blades remain partially constrained by the bench.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 26.18, "mechanical_roles": ["scapular_control", "antagonist_co_contraction", "isometric_fixation"], "tension_fraction": 0.0382, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 0.00, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractil